================================================================================
NOTICE — Scope of the MIT license / 第三方權利與 ROM 版權聲明
================================================================================

The MIT license above covers ONLY the original work authored for this project:
the C11 reconstruction under `src/`, the tooling under `tools/`, the comparison
harness under `comparison/`, the annotated analysis under `analysis/`, and the
accompanying documentation. These are independent works, re-named and re-
structured by this project's authors.

The MIT license does NOT grant any rights in the original game.

The original Famicom title (`中国象棋 [TXC]`), its ROM image, machine code,
graphics, music, and all related copyrights and trademarks remain the property
of their original owner(s) — the cartridge's publisher/developer (TXC
Corporation and the associated Taiwanese unlicensed makers of that era). This
project claims no ownership of, and asserts no rights over, that original work.

- No ROM image is included in or distributed by this repository. The tools
  require a ROM that the user must legally provide themselves.
- The reverse engineering here was performed for interoperability, research,
  preservation, education, and as a tribute to the original author(s).
- All trademarks are the property of their respective owners.

If you are a rights holder and have concerns, please open an issue.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

以上 MIT 授權僅涵蓋本項目原創的部分：`src/` 下的 C11 還原、`tools/` 工具、
`comparison/` 對照程序、`analysis/` 標註分析，以及隨附文檔。這些是由本項目作者
重新命名、重新組織的獨立作品。

MIT 授權不授予對原遊戲的任何權利。

原始 Famicom 遊戲（`中国象棋 [TXC]`）及其 ROM 映像、機器碼、圖像、音樂與一切相關
著作權、商標，均歸原廠所有——即該卡帶的發行/開發商（TXC Corporation 及那個年代
相關的台灣無授權廠商）。本項目不主張對該原作的任何所有權或權利。

- 本倉庫不包含、也不分發任何 ROM 映像；工具所需的 ROM 須由使用者自行合法提供。
- 此處的逆向工程僅用於互操作、研究、保存、教育，以及對原作者的致敬。
- 所有商標歸各自所有者所有。

若您是權利人並有疑慮，請開 issue 告知。
